Some stuff that could be improved with modern C++,<p>Instead of<p><pre><code>    static bool file_exists(const std::string &amp;p) {
        struct stat st{}; return ::stat(p.c_str(), &amp;st) == 0;
    }
      </code></pre>
Use the filesystem API,<p><pre><code>    std::filesystem::exists(path);
</code></pre>
